EXT. DRAINED COMMUNITY POOL - NIGHT

An empty concrete basin under a bruised sky. Chain-link sagging. Leaves in the deep end. Graffiti: a faded dolphin.

Five teenagers perch on the diving board and the ladder rails, passing a flask.

PAISLEY OKORO-WEST (17, braids, a rolled cigarette behind her ear) dangles upside down from the high rail. Her cousin TIBERIUS "TIBBY" LUNDGREN (16, glasses, secondhand letterman) lies spread on the board. Next to him sits FARRUKH SAIDOV (17, soccer shorts), cross-legged. Below them, in the shallow end, DELPHINE "DEL" ARCEO (18, black nail polish) paces, and LUCA BERNARDI (17, fresh sunburn) leans on the wall.

                    PAISLEY
          Tibby, you're going to fall.

                    TIBBY
          That's the plan.

                    FARRUKH
          Tibby, don't.

                    DEL
          Let him. He's been dramatic all week.

                    LUCA
          Del, relax.

                    DEL
          I'm relaxed, Luca.

                    PAISLEY
          You're pacing a trench.

Tibby sits up. The board bounces. Farrukh grabs the rail.

                    TIBBY
          I got into Michigan.

The pool goes silent. Paisley drops from the rail and lands in a crouch.

                    PAISLEY
          Tibby!

                    FARRUKH
          Congratulations, man.

                    LUCA
          That's great.

                    DEL
          (flat)
          Great.

She lifts the flask and drinks. Luca watches her. She hands it to him without looking.

                    TIBBY
          I wasn't going to tell anybody.

                    DEL
          Why not?

                    TIBBY
          Because she'd be like that.

He jerks his chin at her. She spins on him. He holds up both hands.

                    TIBBY (CONT'D)
          Not mean. Just. You know.

                    PAISLEY
          Del, he's allowed to leave.

                    DEL
          I know he is.

She says it with her back turned. The sky flickers with distant lightning. Farrukh slides down from the board. Luca hands her the flask back. She takes it, and drinks again.

                    DEL (CONT'D)
          (quietly)
          Save me a spot in the dorm.

Tibby laughs, and the laugh turns into something else. Paisley hops onto the board and puts her arm around him. He leans into her shoulder.

Farrukh climbs the ladder to the deep end and lowers himself into the dry basin. The others follow, one by one, until all five sit in the center on the leaf-strewn concrete.

                    LUCA
          So. Michigan.

                    TIBBY
          So. Michigan.

Thunder rolls. The first drops of rain hit the bottom of the pool.
